get excited.

287
00:07:31,440 --> 00:07:32,760
What I felt
was warmth.

288
00:07:32,760 --> 00:07:34,480
Not a heating
pad kind of hot.

289
00:07:34,910 --> 00:07:35,460
More like it was

290
00:07:35,460 --> 00:07:36,640
