around it.

292
00:07:38,090 --> 00:07:39,100
And that was it.

293
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:40,670
That was the whole
experience.

294
00:07:40,670 --> 00:07:41,610
When I took it off,

295
00:07:41,610 --> 00:07:42,490
I'll be honest,

296
00:07:42,490 --> 00:07:44,270
nothing dramatic
had happened.

297
00:07:44,270 --> 00:07:46,040
And after what
that video said,

298
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:48,030
that's exactly
what I expected.

299
00:07:48,660 --> 00:07:49,940
What was different
was that

300
00:07:49,940 --> 00:07:50,730
for the first time

301
00:07:50,730 --> 00:07:52,510
in two years I'd
done something

302
00:07:52,510 --> 00:07:54,620
for my knee
instead of to it.

303
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:56,800
Twenty minutes,
in my own chair.

304
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,850
No drive, no copay.

305
00:07:58,850 --> 00:08:00,470
They say twenty
minutes.

306
00:08:00,470 --> 00:08:02,590
I did thirty,
twice a day,

307
00:08:02,590 --> 00:08:04,460
lowest setting
that first week.

308
00:08:05,210 --> 00:08:06,890
Once before I
opened the shop,

309
00:08:06,890 --> 00:08:09,140
once after the last
dog went home.

310
00:08:09,140 --> 00:08:10,150
The first week,

311
00:08:10,150 --> 00:08:10,990
I couldn't have
told you

312
00:08:10,990 --> 00:08:12,370
if anything was
happening.

313
00:08:12,370 --> 00:08:13,020
I tried not

314
00:08:13,020 --> 00:08:14,210
