315
00:08:14,210 --> 00:08:15,100
I'd had things help

316
00:08:15,100 --> 00:08:16,650
for a week and
then stop.

317
00:08:17,180 --> 00:08:19,350
But somewhere in
the second week

318
00:08:19,350 --> 00:08:20,560
I noticed I'd
come down the

319
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:22,890
stairs without
holding the rail.

320
00:08:22,890 --> 00:08:24,400
I hadn't decided to.

321
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,540
I just did it,

322
00:08:25,540 --> 00:08:27,130
then stopped
halfway down

323
00:08:27,130 --> 00:08:28,570
because I realized.

324
00:08:28,570 --> 00:08:29,280
By the end of the

325
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:30,790
fourth week I'd
slept through

326
00:08:30,790 --> 00:08:32,600
