330
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:39,180
None of that
is dramatic.

331
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:40,160
All of it was gone

332
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:41,540
for two years.

333
00:08:41,540 --> 00:08:42,900
A few weeks later

334
00:08:42,900 --> 00:08:44,510
my husband asked
if I wanted

335
00:08:44,510 --> 00:08:45,320
to walk the long

336
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,530
