the block.

337
00:08:47,140 --> 00:08:48,100
And for the
first time

338
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:50,620
in two years,
I said yes.

339
00:08:50,620 --> 00:08:52,400
I wanted to
understand why,

340
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:54,160
so I read the
whole thing.

341
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:55,970
It comes down
to four steps.

342
00:08:55,970 --> 00:08:56,760
One.

343
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:57,790
The tissue
around a new

344
00:08:57,790 --> 00:08:59,430
