is over.

346
00:09:01,860 --> 00:09:02,570
Two.

347
00:09:02,570 --> 00:09:04,900
Inflamed tissue
holds extra fluid,

348
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:05,550
so it takes up

349
00:09:05,550 --> 00:09:07,180
