it should.

350
00:09:07,180 --> 00:09:07,900
Three.

351
00:09:07,900 --> 00:09:09,650
There's only so much
room in there.

352
00:09:09,650 --> 00:09:11,020
Bending
compresses it.

353
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:12,710
Straightening
pulls it tight.

354
00:09:12,710 --> 00:09:14,060
That's the squeeze.

355
00:09:14,060 --> 00:09:15,020
Four.

356
00:09:15,020 --> 00:09:17,390
Red and near-infrared
light have been studied

357
00:09:17,390 --> 00:09:19,290
for calming that
inflammation,

358
00:09:19,290 --> 00:09:20,750
so the swelling
and the pressure

359
00:09:20,750 --> 00:09:22,130
can come
down with it.

360
00:09:22,130 --> 00:09:23,710
In a randomized
trial,

361
00:09:23,710 --> 00:09:25,200
patients given
light therapy

362
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:27,700
after a knee replacement
had less pain,

363
00:09:27,700 --> 00:09:29,330
less swelling and
better early

364
00:09:29,330 --> 00:09:31,170
movement than
those who weren't.

365
00:09:31,750 --> 00:09:34,270
A 2025 review
said the same,

366
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:35,320
and was clear the

367
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:37,170
evidence is
still limited.

368
00:09:37,170 --> 00:09:38,000
I probably sound

369
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,930
like a broken record

370
00:09:38,930 --> 00:09:40,740
