through the night,

376
00:09:47,820 --> 00:09:49,050
say yes to the walk,

377
00:09:49,050 --> 00:09:50,430
and get my
life back.

378
00:09:50,430 --> 00:09:51,670
So take it from me.

379
00:09:52,180 --> 00:09:53,600
Don't spend another
year waiting

380
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,690
